> alpha        3      | [qcrew]  service-guide   project-guide   session-guide   inbox-guide     |                      
  beta         0      |                                                                          |                      
                      | qcrew is a program with a terminal interface for working with several AI |                      
                      | agent command line tools, such as Claude Code and Codex, in parallel     |                      
                      | across several projects.                                                 |                      
                      |                                                                          |                      
                      | Commands:                                                                |                      
                      | - qcrew, qcrew tui: open the terminal interface (at a terminal; without  |                      
                      |   one qcrew shows this overview), see qcrew tui --help                   |                      
                      | - qcrew version: print the version                                       |                      
                      | - qcrew service start|stop|status: control the background service, see   |                      
                      |   the service-guide topic                                                |                      
                      | - qcrew project add|list|remove: register the directories qcrew works    |                      
                      |   in, see the project-guide topic                                        |                      
                      | - qcrew session start|list|stop|attach: run agent tools in the projects, |                      
                      |   see the session-guide topic                                            |                      
                      | - qcrew inbox list|show|answer|close: see what the sessions wait for and |                      
                      |   answer it, see the inbox-guide topic                                   |                      
                      | - qcrew self-update [version], qcrew self-update status: update qcrew    |                      
                      |   itself to the latest stable release or to a given newer one from its   |                      
                      |   signed GitHub releases; status shows the installed version and the     |                      
                      |   latest release and changes nothing (updating needs --confirm)          |                      
                      | - qcrew help <topic>: show a help topic                                  |                      
                      |                                                                          |                      
